[unsendable-channel] Error: a channel cannot carry a `Job`
   ╭─[ example.vaab:4:28 ]
   │
 4 │ let jobs = Channel.new(of: Job, size: 1)
   │                            ─┬─  
   │                             ╰─── this asks for a channel of Job
   │ 
   │ Help: pass the parts of it that are needed, rather than the whole value
   │ 
   │ Note: `Job`'s field `work` is `to(Int) returns Int`; a function value holds on to whatever was around it when it was written, which Vaab has no way to look inside
───╯
